8905564?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/mylovanov/status/2085507804928905564?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 15:29:20 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Possibly AI-written pieces that have won literary awards]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1748846966182985728/Os56vMkU_200x200.jpg"></p><p>james yu (@jamesjyu) on X</p><p>I am starting to keep track of literary awards given to pieces that were written with (or suspected of using) AI. https://t.co/b2FlPXd5us</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/jamesjyu/status/2085335285726900646?s=20">https://x.com/jamesjyu/status/2085335285726900646?s=20</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/saturday-assorted-links-573.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=saturday-assorted-links-573">Saturday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/jamesjyu/status/2085335285726900646?s=20</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/jamesjyu/status/2085335285726900646?s=20</guid><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 15:42:08 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[HuggingFace co-founder on what happened]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2068682157451571200/_ZNKM_5E_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Thomas Wolf (@Thom_Wolf) on X</p><p>Even more than the Hugging Face intrusion, the AISI incident hits close to home for me. It’s the first time I see a model social-engineering a real open-source maintainer while pursuing another goal (in the wild and unprompted). I’ve been an open-source maintainer myself. I</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/Thom_Wolf/status/2085084718320464230">https://x.com/Thom_Wolf/status/2085084718320464230</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/saturday-assorted-links-573.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=saturday-assorted-links-573">Saturda